<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 29 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 3550, tin up 400, lead down 250, zinc up 2225,</p>
<p>aluminium down 3700, nickel up 102, aluminium alloy up 160</p>
</text>
